WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.387
The main lesson from Module 10 is not a particular pivot syntax.

00:00:04.387 --> 00:00:08.127
The main lesson is to control meaning while changing shape.

00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:12.962
State the grain first. Use conditional aggregation for pivots.

00:00:12.962 --> 00:00:16.952
Use union all or lateral values for un pivoting.

00:00:16.952 --> 00:00:20.072
Preserve the difference between null and zero.

00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:26.346
Check joins before aggregating. And always validate row counts and totals after a reshape.
